{"channelId":"UC3CHLiWImcYkBtnhyE-FAjQ","row":["AIM Wellness Education (Aka AIM Online Education)",7700,"AIM Online Education focuses on integrative medicine education.\n\nWelcome to AIM Online Education, your ultimate destination for all things massage! Our channel is dedicated to providing you with high-quality content that helps you relax, de-stress, and rejuvenate your body and mind.\n\nOur team of certified massage therapists brings you the latest massage techniques, tips, and tricks to help you achieve ultimate relaxation and pain relief. From Swedish to deep tissue, hot stone to Thai, we cover it all!\n\nJoin our community of massage enthusiasts and subscribe to our channel for weekly uploads that will leave you feeling refreshed and rejuvenated. Don't forget to hit the bell icon to stay updated with our latest content.\n\nWhether you're a massage newbie or a seasoned pro, we've got something for everyone. So sit back, relax, and let us guide you on your massage journey!","info@aimonline.com","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3CHLiWImcYkBtnhyE-FAjQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3CHLiWImcYkBtnhyE-FAjQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:17.309Z","channelId":"UC3CHLiWImcYkBtnhyE-FAjQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"727e7047b8162167b10fbb34850021b841b96f040a2cca4b9200d016745f2a5a","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"758c2951995d27af807248124c95788dc0d8a92554d3e65f7a3f80a397fbd913"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3CHLiWImcYkBtnhyE-FAjQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:53:31.416Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3CHLiWImcYkBtnhyE-FAjQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":7700,"raw":"7.7K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3CHLiWImcYkBtnhyE-FAjQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:17.309Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@aimonline.com","purpose":"general","own